{"type": "message", "id": "c1874804", "parentId": "9da90763", "timestamp": "2026-04-09T12:31:34.194Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_abf73e7da2124e5591b4603c", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"mesothelioma 5-year survival rate United States statistics\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 995,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"870485ae9b969e16\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSurvival Rates for Pleural Mesothelioma | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"870485ae9b969e16\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/malignant-mesothelioma/detection-diagnosis-staging/survival-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"80f46ed6801fdc60\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe American Cancer Society relies ... Cancer Institute (NCI), to provide survival statistics for different types of cancer. The SEER database tracks 5-year relative survival rates for pleural mesothelioma in the United States, based on how far the cancer has sprea...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"80f46ed6801fdc60\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 3, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ce019599a3793c40\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Survival Rate | Moffitt\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ce019599a3793c40\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.moffitt.org/cancers/mesothelioma/survival-rate/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7aee55ebabd30d0e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAs of 2022, the overall five-year survival rate for advanced stage mesothelioma at Moffitt Cancer Center is <strong>17.3%</strong>. Most cases are diagnosed when the cancer is in an advanced stage and is more difficult to treat.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7aee55ebabd30d0e\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.moffitt.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"61c3ce96a78484db\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Statistics: Incidence, Key Facts & Trends\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"61c3ce96a78484db\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.asbestos.com/mesothelioma/statistics/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e03e67b1b3c68616\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nVeterans account for approximately 30% of all mesothelioma diagnoses in the United States. About 80% of mesothelioma cases are pleural. About 20% are peritoneal. The 5-year survival rate for <strong>pleural mesothelioma is 12%</strong>. For peritoneal mesothelioma, ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e03e67b1b3c68616\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 27, 2016\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.asbestos.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea19826ae08de33c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMesothelioma Survival Rate: What Impacts a Patient's Survival Time?\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea19826ae08de33c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.asbestos.com/mesothelioma/survival-rate/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dd43fb0bdef8d1ea\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe latest 5-year survival rate for pleural mesothelioma is 12%, based on the most recent SEER data. Patients with pleural mesothelioma are about <strong>12% more likely than those without the disease to live at least 5 years after diagnosis</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dd43fb0bdef8d1ea\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 10, 2013\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.asbestos.com\"\n    